  "description": {
   "en": "Takeda and Arita haven't met since their high school graduation, but after taking in an abandoned cat one rainy day, their relationship begins to change. It's not romantic love. They don't have a reason to live together. And yet, they still want to be by each other's side. Faced with these feelings, the answer they decide on is...\n\nA slice of life manga series about trying to break free from the urge to label relationships a certain way.\n___\nNote: Nominated for the 2022 Next Manga Award (Tsugi ni Kuru Manga Taishou) for Best Web Manga.",
   "ja": "高校卒業以来、一度も会うことのなかった武田と有田。ある雨の日に一匹の猫を拾ったことから、二人の関係は変わり始める。恋愛感情とは違う。一緒に暮らす理由もない。でも、君の隣は心地がいい。そんな気持ちに向き合い、二人が出した答えとは――。"
  },
